Package: SPT
Type: Package
Title: Source Projection Transfer for Fixed-Horizon Survival Prediction
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Fangzhou", "Cao", email = "caofzh@mail3.sysu.edu.cn",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Calibrated source projection transfer for fixed-horizon
    survival risk prediction. Projects an external logit score into a
    user-specified target generalized additive model, profiles a bounded
    source-centered smoothness penalty, and selects soft-label strength
    by target cross-validation. Includes GAM, Cox, and inverse-probability
    weighted neural-network source learners.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: mgcv, survival, nnet, stats, utils
NeedsCompilation: no
